          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE   5/347 ASTON CLINTON AYLESBURY ROAD (north side) Threshers Barn, No. 2 Turners Meadow (Formerly listed as Large Barn to north of Vatche's  Farmhouse) II Barn. C18. Timber framed.  Weatharboarded  on brick plinth, w.wall part brick.  Old  tile  roof, quarter hipped  at E.  end. 6 bays,  cart doors in 3rd bay  from W.  irregular doors and loft openings. Interior: curved  braces to tiebeams and wallplates,  4 trusses with tall curved inner principals  supporting lower purlins  and collars below upper purlins.  W. truss  has collar below lower purlins  with raking queenposts. Curved windbraces, old rafters and wall framing. Listing NGR: SP8668612579"
    }
  ],
